---@field createdAt string The timestamp when the issue was created.
---@field updatedAt? string The timestamp when any field of the issue last changed. Advances on every mutation (including score-only updates that do not transition status), so it is greater than or equal to statusUpdatedAt.
---@field evidenceAvailability? aws.continuum.IssueEvidenceAvailability Whether the issue has any attached evidence (formerly 'artifacts': tool output, remediation proposals, patches). NONE = no evidence; AVAILABLE = at least one evidence item exists. Computed at read time.
---@field patchDelivery? aws.continuum.IssuePatchDelivery Customer delivery of the issue's patches, summarized from its PATCH artifacts at read time. Absent when no patch has a destination delivery.

