---A summary of an issue returned in list responses.
---@class aws.continuum.IssueSummary
---@field issueId aws.continuum.IssueId The unique identifier of the issue.
---@field issueArn aws.continuum.IssueArn The ARN of the issue.
---@field name aws.continuum.IssueName The name of the issue.
---@field severity? aws.continuum.IssueSeverity Scanner-derived severity assigned to the issue.
---@field confidence? aws.continuum.IssueConfidence The likelihood that this issue is a true positive, expressed as a percentage (0-100).
---@field status aws.continuum.IssueStatus The current lifecycle status of the issue.
---@field phase? aws.continuum.IssuePhase The part of the workflow the issue is in. Present when status is IN_PROGRESS, and when status is FAILED and the failing phase is known.
---@field statusReason? aws.continuum.IssueStatusReason Why the issue failed. Present only when status is FAILED.
---@field statusMessage? aws.continuum.IssueStatusMessage Customer-facing explanation of statusReason. Present only when status is FAILED.
---@field statusUpdatedAt string The timestamp when the status or phase last changed.
---@field createdAt string The timestamp when the issue was created.
---@field updatedAt? string The timestamp when any field of the issue last changed. Advances on every mutation (including score-only updates that do not transition status), so it is greater than or equal to statusUpdatedAt.

---A free-form synopsis of the issue: reasoning, evidence references, and completion criteria. Supplementary evidence and provenance belong in issue artifacts (added via a separate operation) rather than duplicated here.
