---A likelihood or impact band on prioritization's shared four-value scale.
---@alias aws.continuum.SignalBand "VERY_LOW"|"LOW"|"MODERATE"|"HIGH"

---Where an assessed value came from, strongest evidence first. A customer weighing an assessment reads this to tell a fact read out of their own code from the producer's inference. The first three values name a source that states the value directly. The last two do not: INFERRED means the producer reasoned its way to the value, and NO_EVIDENCE_DEFAULT means it had nothing to reason from and used a d...
---@alias aws.continuum.SignalBasis "CODE"|"GRAPH"|"FINDING"|"INFERRED"|"NO_EVIDENCE_DEFAULT"

---How far the consequences of exploitation reach, widest first.
---@alias aws.continuum.SignalBlastRadius "CROSS_TENANT"|"OTHER_USERS_IN_TENANT"|"OWN_SCOPE"

---The assessed blast-radius dimension with the basis behind it.
