---@class aws.continuum.SignalComputation
---@field likelihoodBand? aws.continuum.SignalBand Computed likelihood band, on a likelihood signal.
---@field impactBand? aws.continuum.SignalBand Computed impact band, on an impact signal.
---@field barriers? number How many of the four exploit preconditions act as barriers (0-4).

---A producer's structured rationale for a signal's confidence.
---@class aws.continuum.SignalConfidenceReasoning
